<title>AUSTRALIA: Stanley Mining accepts Layne C bid.</title>
<headline>Stanley Mining accepts Layne C bid.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian mining contractor Stanley Mining Services Ltd said on Friday its board recommended shareholders accept a takeover offer of A$0.90 a share from Layne Christensen Australia Pty Ltd, wholly owned by Layne Christensen Co of Mission Woods, Kansas, in the absence of a higher offer.</p>
<p>Stanley shareholders are also be entitled to a special fully franked dividend five cents a share to be paid soon.</p>
<p>Based on 95 cents a share, the Layne offer values Stanley's issued capital of 70,219,325 shares at A$66.7 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 612-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
